⚡🇵🇸The president of the Israeli Central Election Commission has ordered the Shin Bet to investigate alleged foreign electoral interference, based on intelligence information described as "exceptionally serious." 

According to broadcaster N12, the suspicions concern funding from Qatar to increase voter turnout among the Arab population in Israel, part of which allegedly passed through channels already used to finance terrorism.

